{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16231010","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16231010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1623101001:1":{"text":"이상한 일... 이상한 일이 일어났습니다. 마법사님! 이상한 일이 일어났다고요!","source_cn":"怪事、怪事啊……魔法师大人，出怪事了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD314F26DC6521C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1623101002:1":{"text":"진정하고 천천히 말해보십시오.","source_cn":"先生，你先喘口气，别着急，慢慢说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x109B326D7EFD2206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1623101003:1":{"text":"집에서 기르는 양이랑 말이 풀을 안 먹어요. 너무 이상하잖아요! 고양이랑 개도 겁에 질려서 꼼짝도 못 하고, 밤만 되면 귀신 들린 것처럼 울어대요!","source_cn":"太奇怪了，家里的羊和马都不吃草了！猫猫狗狗也都吓得不敢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB666EEB6FE65AA1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1623101004:1":{"text":"밀밭 근처를 한 바퀴 다 돌아봤는데도 원인을 못 찾겠더라고요. 그래서 혹시... 마법이랑 관련이 있지 않을까 싶어서요.","source_cn":"俺在麦田附近排查了一圈也没发现是怎么回事，所以就想……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAC0CC81052696E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1623101005:1":{"text":"아시잖아요. 저희 같은 마을 사람들은 마법에 대해 아무것도 모르는걸요... 혹시 봐주실 수 없나요?","source_cn":"俺们这些村民，你也知道……对魔法一窍不通，能麻烦你们去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02B5E8E77326A1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1623101006:1":{"text":"음... 동물들이 동시에 겁을 먹을 정도라면 평범한 일은 아닐 텐데...","source_cn":"唔……能让整群动物一起惊慌的，肯定不是普通事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8087511BAA224C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1623101007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 가서 살펴봐 주실 수 있겠습니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26CCAF72270B84A0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 가서 살펴봐 주실 수 있겠습니까?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 가서 살펴봐 주실 수 있겠습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"217095","variant_female_record_index":"217096","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民查理":{"text":"마을 주민 찰리","source":"村民查理","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:赫普":{"text":"헤플러","source":"赫普","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}